== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: nop [ENC: DEFAULT, MAP: 0F, OPC: 0x1B]
     LENGTH:  4
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: WIDENOP
    ISA-SET: PPRO
    ISA-EXT: BASE
 EXCEPTIONS: NONE
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM 
  OPTIMIZED: 0F 1F C6 

